{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":36,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David the servant of the LORD.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":", A Psalm of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"The transgression of the wicked saith within my heart, that there is no fear of God before his eyes.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"transgression","s":["H6588"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"saith","s":["H5002"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"within","s":["H7130"],"a":[3]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[4]},{"t":", that there is no "},{"t":"fear","s":["H6343"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":" before his "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"For he flattereth himself in his own eyes, until his iniquity be found to be hateful.","tok":[{"t":"For he "},{"t":"flattereth","s":["H2505"],"a":[1]},{"t":" himself in his own "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[3]},{"t":", until his "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[5]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"hateful","s":["H8130"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The words of his mouth are iniquity and deceit: he hath left off to be wise, and to do good.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"deceit","s":["H4820"],"a":[3]},{"t":": he hath left "},{"t":"off","s":["H2308"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"wise","s":["H7919"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and to do "},{"t":"good","s":["H3190"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"He deviseth mischief upon his bed; he setteth himself in a way that is not good; he abhorreth not evil.","tok":[{"t":"He "},{"t":"deviseth","s":["H2803"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mischief","s":["H0205"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon his "},{"t":"bed","s":["H4904"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; he "},{"t":"setteth","s":["H3320"],"a":[4]},{"t":" himself in a "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that is not "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; he "},{"t":"abhorreth","s":["H3988"],"a":[11]},{"t":" not "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Thy mercy, O LORD, is in the heavens; and thy faithfulness reacheth unto the clouds.","tok":[{"t":"Thy "},{"t":"mercy","s":["H2617"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":", is in the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; and thy "},{"t":"faithfulness","s":["H0530"],"a":[3]},{"t":" reacheth unto the "},{"t":"clouds","s":["H7834"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Thy righteousness is like the great mountains; thy judgments are a great deep: O LORD, thou preservest man and beast.","tok":[{"t":"Thy "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is like the "},{"t":"great","s":["H0410"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mountains","s":["H2042"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; thy "},{"t":"judgments","s":["H4941"],"a":[3]},{"t":" are a "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8415"],"a":[4]},{"t":": O "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", thou "},{"t":"preservest","s":["H3467"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"beast","s":["H0929"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"How excellent is thy lovingkindness, O God! therefore the children of men put their trust under the shadow of thy wings.","tok":[{"t":"How "},{"t":"excellent","s":["H3368"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is thy "},{"t":"lovingkindness","s":["H2617"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":"! therefore the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":" put their "},{"t":"trust","s":["H2620"],"a":[8]},{"t":" under the "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of thy "},{"t":"wings","s":["H3671"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"They shall be abundantly satisfied with the fatness of thy house; and thou shalt make them drink of the river of thy pleasures.","tok":[{"t":"They shall be abundantly "},{"t":"satisfied","s":["H7301"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"fatness","s":["H1880"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of thy "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; and thou shalt make them "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8248"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5158"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of thy "},{"t":"pleasures","s":["H5730"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"For with thee is the fountain of life: in thy light shall we see light.","tok":[{"t":"For with thee is the "},{"t":"fountain","s":["H4726"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"life","s":["H2416"],"a":[3]},{"t":": in thy "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[4]},{"t":" shall we "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"O continue thy lovingkindness unto them that know thee; and thy righteousness to the upright in heart.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"continue","s":["H4900"],"a":[0]},{"t":" thy "},{"t":"lovingkindness","s":["H2617"],"a":[1]},{"t":" unto them that "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[2]},{"t":" thee; and thy "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Let not the foot of pride come against me, and let not the hand of the wicked remove me.","tok":[{"t":"Let not the "},{"t":"foot","s":["H7272"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1346"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against me, and let not the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"remove","s":["H5110"],"a":[7]},{"t":" me."}]},{"n":12,"text":"There are the workers of iniquity fallen: they are cast down, and shall not be able to rise.","tok